{"id":28690,"slug":"the-asphalt-jungle","title":"The Asphalt Jungle","year":1950,"country":"United States","duration":112,"spine":847,"url":"https://www.criterion.com/films/28690-the-asphalt-jungle","cover":"https://s3.amazonaws.com/criterion-production/films/5915895741543b0081c1afe507308335/WLD2n1FIo9i7BTFQRoTryfcBlF1rse_large.jpg","description":"In a smog-choked city somewhere in the American Midwest, an aging criminal mastermind, newly released from prison, hatches a plan for a million-dollar jewel heist and draws a wealthy lawyer and a cherry-picked trio of outlaws into his carefully devised but inevitably doomed scheme. Anchored by an abundance of nuanced performances from a gifted ensemble—including a tight-jawed Sterling Hayden and a sultry Marilyn Monroe in her breakout role—this gritty crime classic by John Huston climaxes in a meticulously detailed anatomy of a robbery that has reverberated through the genre ever since. An uncommonly naturalistic view of a seamy underworld, The Asphalt Jungle painstakingly depicts the calm professionalism and toughness of its gangster heroes while evincing a remarkable depth of compassion for their all-too-human fragility, and it showcases a master filmmaker at the height of his powers.","boxset":0,"scraped":1,"directors":[{"name":"John Huston","slug":"john-huston"}],"cast":[{"actor":"Sterling Hayden","role":"Dix Handley","slug":"sterling-hayden"},{"actor":"Louis Calhern","role":"Alonzo D. Emmerich","slug":"louis-calhern"},{"actor":"Jean Hagen","role":"Doll Conovan","slug":"jean-hagen"},{"actor":"James Whitmore","role":"Gus Minissi","slug":"james-whitmore"},{"actor":"Sam Jaffe","role":"Doc Erwin Riedenschneider","slug":"sam-jaffe"},{"actor":"John McIntire","role":"Police Commissioner Hardy","slug":"john-mcintire"},{"actor":"Marc Lawrence","role":"Cobby","slug":"marc-lawrence"},{"actor":"Barry Kelley","role":"Lieutenant Ditrich","slug":"barry-kelley"},{"actor":"Anthony Caruso","role":"Louis Ciavelli","slug":"anthony-caruso"